steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1777991779
      nanos: 633068789
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Replace all hardcoded member data in the Members section with real \nFirestore reads and writes.\n\n1. LOAD MEMBERS (on page load and after any change):\n   async function loadMembers() {\n     show loading spinner\n     const snapshot = await db.collection(\'members\')\n       .orderBy(\'createdAt\', \'desc\')\n       .get()\n     members = snapshot.docs.map(doc => ({ id: doc.id, ...doc.data() }))\n     renderMembersTable(members)\n     hide loading spinner\n   }\n\n2. ADD MEMBER (form submit):\n   - Collect all form field values\n   - Auto-calculate expiryDate based on plan selected:\n     Monthly = startDate + 30 days\n     Quarterly = startDate + 90 days  \n     Half-Yearly = startDate + 180 days\n     Annual = startDate + 365 days\n   - Set status = \"active\" if today < expiryDate else \"expired\"\n   - Generate memberId = \"CNX\" + Date.now() last 6 digits\n   - Upload photo to Firebase Storage at path: members/{memberId}/photo\n   - Get photoURL after upload\n   - Save to Firestore: db.collection(\'members\').add({...memberData, createdAt: firebase.firestore.FieldValue.serverTimestamp()})\n   - Also create a payment record in \'payments\' collection for this new membership\n   - Show success toast: \"Member added successfully!\"\n   - Reload members list\n\n3. EDIT MEMBER:\n   - Pre-fill modal form with existing member data\n   - On save: db.collection(\'members\').doc(memberId).update({...updatedData, updatedAt: serverTimestamp()})\n\n4. DELETE MEMBER:\n   - Confirmation dialog: \"Are you sure? This will delete all records for [Name].\"\n   - Delete member doc + their attendance records + their measurement records\n   - Use batch delete\n\n5. REAL-TIME STATUS CHECK:\n   - Every time members load, auto-update status field:\n     if today > expiryDate \342\206\222 set status to \"expired\"\n     if today is within 7 days of expiryDate \342\206\222 set status to \"expiring_soon\"\n   - Run this check using a Firestore query for members where expiryDate < today\n\n6. SEARCH & FILTER:\n   - Search: filter loaded members array by name or phone (client-side)\n   - Filter by status: Firestore query with .where(\'status\', \'==\', selectedStatus)\n\n7. MEMBER PROFILE page:\n   - Load member data: db.collection(\'members\').doc(memberId).get()\n   - Load their payments: db.collection(\'payments\').where(\'memberId\',\'==\',memberId).orderBy(\'date\',\'desc\').get()\n   - Load their attendance: db.collection(\'attendance\').where(\'memberId\',\'==\',memberId).orderBy(\'checkInDate\',\'desc\').limit(20).get()\n\nShow the full updated Members section code with all Firestore operations."
    items {
      text: "Replace all hardcoded member data in the Members section with real \nFirestore reads and writes.\n\n1. LOAD MEMBERS (on page load and after any change):\n   async function loadMembers() {\n     show loading spinner\n     const snapshot = await db.collection(\'members\')\n       .orderBy(\'createdAt\', \'desc\')\n       .get()\n     members = snapshot.docs.map(doc => ({ id: doc.id, ...doc.data() }))\n     renderMembersTable(members)\n     hide loading spinner\n   }\n\n2. ADD MEMBER (form submit):\n   - Collect all form field values\n   - Auto-calculate expiryDate based on plan selected:\n     Monthly = startDate + 30 days\n     Quarterly = startDate + 90 days  \n     Half-Yearly = startDate + 180 days\n     Annual = startDate + 365 days\n   - Set status = \"active\" if today < expiryDate else \"expired\"\n   - Generate memberId = \"CNX\" + Date.now() last 6 digits\n   - Upload photo to Firebase Storage at path: members/{memberId}/photo\n   - Get photoURL after upload\n   - Save to Firestore: db.collection(\'members\').add({...memberData, createdAt: firebase.firestore.FieldValue.serverTimestamp()})\n   - Also create a payment record in \'payments\' collection for this new membership\n   - Show success toast: \"Member added successfully!\"\n   - Reload members list\n\n3. EDIT MEMBER:\n   - Pre-fill modal form with existing member data\n   - On save: db.collection(\'members\').doc(memberId).update({...updatedData, updatedAt: serverTimestamp()})\n\n4. DELETE MEMBER:\n   - Confirmation dialog: \"Are you sure? This will delete all records for [Name].\"\n   - Delete member doc + their attendance records + their measurement records\n   - Use batch delete\n\n5. REAL-TIME STATUS CHECK:\n   - Every time members load, auto-update status field:\n     if today > expiryDate \342\206\222 set status to \"expired\"\n     if today is within 7 days of expiryDate \342\206\222 set status to \"expiring_soon\"\n   - Run this check using a Firestore query for members where expiryDate < today\n\n6. SEARCH & FILTER:\n   - Search: filter loaded members array by name or phone (client-side)\n   - Filter by status: Firestore query with .where(\'status\', \'==\', selectedStatus)\n\n7. MEMBER PROFILE page:\n   - Load member data: db.collection(\'members\').doc(memberId).get()\n   - Load their payments: db.collection(\'payments\').where(\'memberId\',\'==\',memberId).orderBy(\'date\',\'desc\').get()\n   - Load their attendance: db.collection(\'attendance\').where(\'memberId\',\'==\',memberId).orderBy(\'checkInDate\',\'desc\').limit(20).get()\n\nShow the full updated Members section code with all Firestore operations."
    }
  }
}
